  "body": "Nestled in the coveted neighbourhood of Grovenor Drive, welcome to number 123. Set on a freehold site spanning 607sqm and featuring a floor area of 264sqm; this two storey home with elevated views sweeping across Orewa towards the beach, evokes elegance with modern luxury.\r\n\r\nDouble front doors open to a wide, welcoming entranceway, creating a striking first impression and a natural transition into the open-plan living spaces where scale, natural light and sophisticated interiors create an immediate sense of grandeur. The living area is anchored by generous seating and curated statement furnishings, while the expansive curved wall of floor-to-ceiling glazing draws the garden into the living space, creating a beautiful connection with the outdoors.\r\n\r\nBeautifully appointed, the kitchen combines functionality and considered design. A distinctive pressed-metal splashback provides a sophisticated textural element, complemented by a substantial 900mm Fisher & Paykel five-burner gas hob for effortless everyday cooking and entertaining. The charming bay window, extending from ceiling to benchtop, offers a captivating outlook over the productive garden; bringing the beauty of the outdoors directly into the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is thoughtfully completed by a dedicated formal lounge/media room, a guest bedroom or office, powder room and galley style laundry. \r\n\r\nThe feature stairwell defined by a contemporary metal balustrade, leads to the accommodation floor above, where four bedrooms including a luxurious premier suite, form a private retreat distinctly separated from the main living spaces below. \r\n\r\nThis level is complemented by two generously proportioned bathrooms, including the luxurious ensuite to the premier suite. Both feature floor-to-ceiling tiling and spacious walk-in showers, while the main bathroom adds a freestanding bath for a considered touch of indulgence.\r\n\r\nExtending effortlessly from both the family room and formal lounge, the outdoor entertaining area provides a seamless connection between the interiors and beautifully landscaped gardens. A tranquil water feature adds a sense of calm, creating an inviting setting for relaxed gatherings and alfresco living.\r\n\r\nBeautifully considered for modern family living, this exceptional home brings together generous proportions, refined finishes and effortless indoor-outdoor connection. With its thoughtfully separated living and accommodation levels, elegant entertaining spaces and beautifully landscaped grounds, it offers a rare opportunity to secure a home where comfort, style and functionality come together with ease. For those seeking something truly special, this is a home that deserves to be experienced in person.\r\n\r\nOPEN FOR INSPECTION | As Scheduled or By Private Appointment; Twilight Viewings Available.\r\nPROPERTY DOCUMENTS AVAILABLE | https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/IESG",
